{"v":4,"desc":"事實上，你吃什麼就是什麼，在 Frogvival 中你可以體驗到這種評估。\n\nFrogvival 是一款生存遊戲，你可以吞噬動物並使其變異！ 你可以收集食物來烹飪，你可以製作武器和物品。 你可以建造、戰鬥、探索並創造你自己的充滿青蛙的世界！\n\n在青蛙生存你可以：\n建造你的房子，建造不同的地板和牆壁\n用書架、地毯和繪畫等 50 多種物品裝飾您的房子\n沼澤生存\n烹飪美味佳餚來滿足永無止境的飢餓\n探索你周圍廣闊的世界！","publisher":"Marginalact","release":"2023-11-24","genres":["動作","街機","角色扮演","策略"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.5GB / Switch 0.5GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/013343dd140becccd9f1ad218027bfc98c121b89c45a9f4e0f3c6cffda833f0c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/faafcdc6a46cbf1f934af682becd172909d071851565d573ac123bc985701b5a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3b1eaae1aa630f67837341420aee0e1d0157e8676c84b60a26c0855ea58e3125.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fc34be2aed5f4b73c55a3ab0adce7f14e17d397dea5ce64d148267f91689b7f5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9f7a6cc3685634a1a643eee54b9473d52b6b3476fd1e7e68e302b149c0b7e70c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ac2e1c6737aefbe2a6156346cc6b559eef6737043807d86694f8e19b38400f77.jpg"],"titleId":"0100b2801cbf8000","dlc":[]}